127
00:10:01,368 --> 00:10:03,070
<font color="#ffff54">- Temper, temper.
- Shut up.</font>

128
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,581
<font color="#ffff54">Sorry.</font>

129
00:10:17,751 --> 00:10:19,353
<font color="#ffff54">Sorry, Heathcliff.</font>

130
00:10:21,823 --> 00:10:23,892
<font color="#ffff54">Do you want to try again?
I'll be more patient,</font>

131
