159
00:13:22,302 --> 00:13:24,806
<font color="#ffff54">It is my birthday, Catherine,</font>

160
00:13:24,939 --> 00:13:26,573
<font color="#ffff54">and you have kept me waiting.</font>

161
00:13:27,708 --> 00:13:29,509
