175
00:14:09,549 --> 00:14:11,151
<font color="#ffff54">Are you trembling?</font>

176
00:14:11,284 --> 00:14:14,588
<font color="#ffff54">Stop at once. You make me feel
like a brute. Stop it, I say.</font>

177
00:14:14,721 --> 00:14:16,090
<font color="#ffff54">Papa, please.
It was not his fault.</font>

178
00:14:16,223 --> 00:14:19,693
<font color="#ffff54">I feed you, and clothe you,</font>

179
00:14:19,827 --> 00:14:22,964
<font color="#ffff54">and save you
